meta {
  name: Health check
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{issuerMgmtUrl}}/api/check/health
  body: none
  auth: none
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.isSystemHealthy: eq true
}

docs {
  ADR 0023: the health check of the issuer, EDC's HealthStatus shape. The same checks as
  "Readiness"; 503 when one fails. No API key. The plain GET /health on the same port
  answers 200 "ok" and checks nothing.
}
